# Equipment & Facility Work Order (FEN-001) — developer guide

Shared **cross-department** module. One URL for everyone; data is scoped by `localStorage.department`.  
**Do not** copy this module under `qa/`, `purchase/`, `production/`, etc.

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| URL | `/equipment-work-order` |
| Lazy module | `src/app/equipment-work-order/equipment-work-order.module.ts` |
| Route register | `app.module.ts` → `EquipmentWorkOrderModule` |
| API | `phpmedicap/engineering/equipment_work_order.php` |
| Table | `equipment_facility_work_order` |
| Theme CSS | `work-order-form.theme.css` (`wof__*`) |
| Sidebar | `<app-equipment-work-order-sidebar-link>` on dept hubs |
| Pattern twin | `/preventiveimain` (same shared-module idea) |
| WI / Ref | **WI-EN-001-01** |
| Plant | `1126` (via `DataAccessService` / `plant_id`) |

Related shared-module checklist: `.cursor/rules/medicap-dept-shared-modules.mdc`.

