## Who sees which hub cards

Department from `localStorage.getItem('department')` (lowercased for checks).

| Card | Route | Category | Visible when |
|------|-------|----------|--------------|
| New Work Order | `new` | Initiator | **All** depts |
| Engineering Review | `engg-review` | Engineering | name includes `engineering` or `maintenance` |
| Work Performed | `work-performed` | Engineering | same |
| Work Order Verification | `verification` | Initiator | **All** |
| QA Approval | `qa-approval` | QA | `qa` / `quality assurance` |
| Work Order Log | `log` | Records | **All** (own dept data only) |
| Issuance Log (Final) | `issuance-log` | Engineering | Engg only |

Aliases: `part-b` → Work Performed; `verify` → verification; old `interior-checklist` / `exterior-checklist` **redirect** to `work-performed`.

Screen titles must **not** say “Part A/B/C” (PDF body text for Form B may still say Part A).

