## End-to-end status flow

```text
Any dept: New Work Order (Equipment OR Area)
        ↓  status TO_ENGG_REVIEW
Engineering: Engineering Review
        ↓  status TO_PART_B
Engineering: Work Performed
        • Equipment → work fields only
        • Area → MUST pick Interior (C) or Exterior (D) checklist + work fields
        ↓  status TO_VERIFY
Initiating dept: Verification
        ↓  if qa_approval_required = Yes → TO_QA
        ↓  if No → CLOSED (closed_by/date = verifier)
QA (only if required): QA Approval → CLOSED
        ↓
Engineering Issuance Log shows CLOSED + TO_QA (all depts)
```

Legacy status `TO_AREA_CHECKLIST` is auto-migrated to `TO_PART_B` on `getByStatus` (checklists live inside Work Performed now).

### Status meanings

| Status | Meaning | Who acts |
|--------|---------|----------|
| `TO_ENGG_REVIEW` | Waiting engg GMP / historical / QA-required review | Engineering |
| `TO_PART_B` | Waiting work performed (+ Area checklist) | Engineering |
| `TO_VERIFY` | Waiting initiating dept to verify | That dept |
| `TO_QA` | QA reinstate approval required | QA |
| `CLOSED` | Finished | — (Issuance Log) |

