| `type=` | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `getEquipmentByDepartment` | Fallback equipment list for New |
| `getAreasByDepartment` | Areas for New (location / section) |
| `savePartA` | Create WO → `TO_ENGG_REVIEW` |
