## PDF rules (keep when editing)

### FEN-001-01-A (`downloadIssuanceLogPdf`)

1. Landscape A4, drawn dynamically (no scanned full-page overlay).  
2. Logo + `Ref: WI-EN-001-01`.  
3. Header: TITLE / FORM NO. FEN-001-01-A / blank DEPT & QA approval cells (no signatures) / REV 00 / EFFECTIVE MAY 06 2025 / PAGE.  
4. Columns only: Work Order # | Date of Initiation | Initiated By & Date | Brief Description of Problem | Closed By & Date.  
5. Data from first row; pad only **3** blank rows.  
6. Confidential footer.

### FEN-001-01-B (`downloadWorkOrderPdf`)

Portrait A4; logo + control header Form B; filled Part A / engg / verification / QA sections from record.

